        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cable car, for passenger transport</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cable car, for passenger transport
No specific data was avaiable therefore the cable car cabine was aproximated with the production of a regional train.;
UUID: bc991dc2-ecc3-35fb-800c-d0db72008995
Included is the production of one single cable car cabine (total weight of the cabins 2.8t) of an average cable car  with a capacity of 35 persons.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 12
Sampling: Approximation with the production of a regional train 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc991dc2-ecc3-35fb-800c-d0db72008995.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
